<title>POLAND: Polish Szczecin port H1 cargo transfer up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish Szczecin port H1 cargo transfer up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GDANSK, Poland 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo transfer in the Polish port of Szczecin-Swinoujscie rose 15.8 percent in the first half of this year against the same period of last year to 8.1 million tonnes, the port's management said on Monday.</p>
<p> (IN MLN T)		 H1 1997   H1 1996  pct difference</p>
<p> TOTAL			  8.10     6.99	15.8</p>
<p> COAL			   4.22     3.17	32.9</p>
<p> IRON ORE		     1.38     1.69     -17.9</p>
<p> MASS PRODUCTS		0.55     0.56	-2.5</p>
<p> GRAIN			  0.38     0.34	12.4</p>
<p> WOOD			   0.025    0.023	8.7</p>
<p> SMALL BULK		   1.55     1.21	27.6</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
